<title>USA: Millennium America files for $750 mln offer.</title>
<headline>Millennium America files for $750 mln offer.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Millennium America Inc, an indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of Millennium Chemicals said Tuesday it filed a registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $750 million in notes and debentures.</p>
<p>The offering includes senior notes due Nov 2006 and senior debentures due Nov 2026, the filing said.</p>
</text>
